# Real-world proof + PR review bots

> **When:** class **U** or **S** per [`mdeai-workflow.mdc`](./mdeai-workflow.mdc). Docs-only PRs skip Part B local bots.

Orchestrates: [`mdeai-testing.mdc`](./mdeai-testing.mdc) · [`mdeai-live-prod-check.mdc`](./mdeai-live-prod-check.mdc) · [`mdeai-done-gate.mdc`](./mdeai-done-gate.mdc) · [`pr-agent.mdc`](./pr-agent.mdc) · skill `coderabbit` · skill `run-review`

**Principle:** Unit tests alone are not proof. Every persona-visible change needs **interactive browser proof** saved to disk. Every PR must **run and resolve** cubic + CodeRabbit feedback before merge. **PR-Agent** (PR #236) auto-reviews on open/sync — triage its comments too; see `pr-agent.mdc`.

---

## Part A — Real-world browser proof (mandatory)

### When required

Any change to **chat, cards, maps, host, events, landings, checkout, agents, or persona-visible UI** — before **opening PR**, **In Review**, or **Done**.

### Tools (pick ≥1 — all are valid real-world proof)

| Tool | Use for |
|------|---------|
| **Cursor Browser MCP** | Default — interactive persona flow, snapshot, `browser_take_screenshot` |
| **Playwright** | Automated e2e; hero/chat via `e2e/helpers/maps-layout.ts` |
| **Chrome DevTools MCP** | Console, network, a11y — use for proof **or** when Browser/Playwright fails |

**At least one** of Browser MCP, Playwright, or Chrome DevTools MCP is **required** — Vitest/curl alone does not count.

### Environments (both columns in evidence)

| Environment | URL | When |
|-------------|-----|------|
| **Localhost** | `http://localhost:3001/` (read `[ui]` port from `npm run dev`) | **Always** — fresh dev restart first |
| **Production** | `https://www.mdeai.co/` or `https://mdeai.co/` | Before merge / ship claims; after deploy for P0 |

If prod not deployed yet → evidence must say **PROD BLOCKED (PR open)** — do not fake PASS.

### Minimum proof per task

1. **Restart dev** — kill stale `[ui]`/`[agent]`; confirm GET `/` → 200
2. **Persona journey** — navigate to touched surface; perform AC action (e.g. Andrés opens event detail, sees skeleton → content)
3. **Screenshot** — save under `tasks/testing/evidence/YYYY-MM-DD/SAN-###-<surface>.png`
4. **Console** — no uncaught errors (Browser MCP snapshot or Playwright `assertConsoleClean`)
5. **Network** — no 401/403/500 on touched APIs (Chrome DevTools MCP if needed)
6. **Repeat on prod** when PR targets merge (curl + browser or `chat-smoke.mjs --base https://www.mdeai.co`)

### Evidence file (required)

Path: `tasks/testing/evidence/YYYY-MM-DD/SAN-###-<slug>-RESULTS.md`

Each browser row must include:

```markdown
| Check | localhost | prod |
|-------|-----------|------|
| Real-world browser | PASS + screenshot path | PASS/BLOCKED + screenshot path |
| Console clean | PASS/FAIL | PASS/FAIL |
| Network (touched APIs) | PASS/FAIL | PASS/FAIL |
```

Copy screenshots from `mdeapp/tmp/screenshots/` into the evidence folder when Playwright wrote there.

### Anti-patterns

- ❌ "Playwright passed" with no screenshot in evidence
- ❌ curl-only proof for UI tasks
- ❌ Skipping localhost because dev was already running (stale server)
- ❌ Claiming prod PASS before merge deploy

